OL,3,GNEWSAJulie Hesmondhalgh left Celebrity
OL,4,ATraitors 'with my head held high'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSoap star Julie Hesmondhalgh - the most
OL,7,Frecently banished contestant from The
OL,8,FCelebrity Traitors - says she left the
OL,9,Fshow with her "head held high".
OL,11,FThe former Coronation Street actress,
OL,12,Ffrom Accrington, Lancashire, starred as
OL,13,Fa faithful contestant in the second
OL,14,Fseries of the BBC One show - before
OL,15,Fbeing voted out by other players on
OL,16,FFriday's episode.
OL,18,FHesmondhalgh said she "had no idea" she
OL,19,Fwas going to be banished.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
