OL,3,GNEWSAJulie Hesmondhalgh left Celebrity
OL,4,ATraitors 'with my head held high'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It became clear it was going to be me
OL,7,Fand I was a bit worried," she told BBC
OL,8,FRadio Manchester. "I did feel it was my
OL,9,Ftime and I left with my head held high.
OL,10,FBut I have to say I had some very
OL,11,Fgratifying apologetic texts on Friday
OL,12,Fnight."
